# Early Bird Catches the Bookworm (windurst 20): the offer's `or` for a Bastok char that a GM gave Windurst mission 2-1
# (Lost for Words) current: the nation side is already true, so 387 whatever the mission (a port that tested the
# mission alone would return nil). 2-1 at status 0 has no Tosuka-Porika action.
lists WindurstWaters/Tosuka-Porika/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/387
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-27.2,-5.25,104.4
quest Windurst.GlyphHanger completed
fame Windurst 50
mission Windurst LostForWords current
login
trigger Tosuka-Porika               # a Bastok char, 2-1 current: 387
finish option=1                     # declined: nothing
